WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.827
When you're in Germany, you eat sausage.

00:00:01.827 --> 00:00:03.928
That's pretty much what they have.

00:00:03.928 --> 00:00:05.773
They have a lot of sausage here.

00:00:05.773 --> 00:00:08.675
I had sausage for breakfast,
you have sausage for lunch,

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.093
