00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:12.536
I went to a bar, they
put sausage in a glass,

00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:13.965
and you drink it.
(audience chuckles)

00:00:13.965 --> 00:00:14.872
It's crazy.

00:00:14.872 --> 00:00:15.779
See that little girl over there?

00:00:15.779 --> 00:00:17.155
That's a sausage lollipop

00:00:17.155 --> 00:00:18.872
