00:00:23.752 --> 00:00:24.595
Benser.

00:00:24.595 --> 00:00:25.875
You make sausage.

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:28.712
(German language), I'm the
Master, (German language).

00:00:28.712 --> 00:00:29.555
You're the master-
Yes.

00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:30.760
of making sausage.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.763
(German language)

00:00:31.763 --> 00:00:33.459
Well, you have a high
opinion of yourself, do you?

00:00:33.459 --> 00:00:34.867
(audience laughs)

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.040
Tell me what's going on here.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:36.873
Grobe mettwurst.

00:00:36.873 --> 00:00:37.706
[Conan] Okay.

00:00:37.706 --> 00:00:39.944
Zwiebelmettwurst.

00:00:39.944 --> 00:00:40.777
