was in a horrible accident!

00:01:07.336 --> 00:01:08.840
(German language)
Agh!

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.691
Eat (German language).

00:01:10.691 --> 00:01:11.524
Eat!

00:01:11.524 --> 00:01:12.357
[Conan] Can I,

00:01:12.357 --> 00:01:13.190
