00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:17.700
No!

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.783
(laughs)

00:01:20.771 --> 00:01:23.624
So (German language) so, here!

00:01:23.624 --> 00:01:24.457
Mmm.

00:01:24.457 --> 00:01:25.395
Mmm.

00:01:25.395 --> 00:01:26.611
Mmm.

00:01:26.611 --> 00:01:27.444
Mmm.

00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:33.005
